{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Day With Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Shake a Tail Feather ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future - <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span> in time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">If/When/Before/After</span> + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will/be going to </span>+ Simple Present tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">After</span> means at a later time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Before I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm. <br/>After I set my alarm, I'm going to go to sleep.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.</span> (I'm not sure that I'll go to sleep.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I go to bed, I'll set my alarm.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Before we go, I'll have to lie down.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I decide to go, I'll just meet him there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you decide on something, I'll pick you up.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Clarification and Emphasizing a Point", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details on what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions.</span><br/> An embedded question is a question included in another question or statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example</span>: <br/><span class=\"strong\">Simple question:</span> What are you going to do after dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question:</span> Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I don't know why you would want to dance with me! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you know where this new club is that Peter is talking about? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Do you remember what the name is?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be buried", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put under ground or many things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My phone is buried in my bag. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to finish up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to finish", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm just finishing up a picnic lunch with Sally.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "club", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for nightclub; a place to dance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to check out the new club.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to open up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to open", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to see the new club that opened up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "minutes", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pre-paid time available to talk on the phone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I don't have any minutes left! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shake a tail feather", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to dance ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Oh, come on! Shake a tail feather! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use the newspaper or Internet to find social activities for the weekend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 3 ideas for socializing with friends.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Put them in order of most exciting to least exciting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a social activity schedule for the weekend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Invite a friend to come out with you this weekend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about connected events in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le16ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Before we go, I'll have to lie down - I'm so full! Isn't that your phone?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Oh, yeah. It's buried in my bag. Hello?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Hey Vanessa, it's Peter. What's up?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     I'm just finishing up a picnic lunch with Sally. How are you?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         I'm good. I'm not sure what you're doing tonight, but I'm wondering if you want to come out dancing with me?"}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "26000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Dancing?! I don't know why you would want to dance with me! I'm not a very good ...<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Oh, come on! Shake a tail feather! I want to check out this new club that opened up last week. It's called Shimmer.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Before I go out anywhere, I'll have to find the right shoes and dress to wear.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         You can borrow something of mine!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         If you decide on something, I'll pick you up at -"}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "47000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Oh, no! My battery died!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Here, use mine ... wait, I don't have any minutes left! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Do you know where this new club is that Peter is talking about? If I decide to go, I'll just meet him there. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         I'm not sure ... Do you remember what the name is?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Shimmer."}], "aud